# Keqing Furina Sara Xianyun. ~24s Rot. Keqing Taser Plunge. After 5 plunges, Xianyun refeshes VV. Keqing always catches Sara's crowfeather. Hold skill aerial plunge not implemented. 50% Collisons.

# Team
keqing char lvl=90/90 cons=0 talent=9,9,9;
keqing add weapon="harbinger" refine=5 lvl=90/90;
